---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Abyss Hub — Independent Technology, Thoughtfully Built" description="Abyss Hub develops independent digital products, software, and technology projects." active="">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Independent technology company</span><h1 class="display">Ideas into<br /><span>digital reality.</span></h1>
      <p>Abyss Hub is an independent technology company building digital products, software, and connected experiences. We bring focused ideas into well-crafted projects made to evolve.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/projects">Explore our work <span>↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/about">Discover Abyss Hub</a></div>
      <div class="hero-meta"><span class="pulse"></span> Independent by nature. Built for what comes next.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="orbit-core"><img src="/abysshub-logo.png" alt="" /></div><span class="orbit-tag one">DIGITAL PRODUCTS</span><span class="orbit-tag two">SOFTWARE & SYSTEMS</span><span class="orbit-tag three">NEW POSSIBILITIES</span></div>
  </div></section>
  <div class="stats-strip"><div class="container stats-inner"><div class="stat"><strong>Independent thinking</strong><span>Ideas shaped with intent</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Product-led approach</strong><span>Useful experiences over noise</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Always evolving</strong><span>Building, refining, moving forward</span></div></div></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div class="copy-block"><span class="eyebrow">The company</span><div class="section-head"><h2>A home for technology with a purpose.</h2><p>Abyss Hub brings together a growing portfolio of independent digital projects under one identity.</p></div><p>From software tools to digital platforms, each project starts with a clear direction and room to grow. Our focus is on thoughtful execution, dependable foundations, and experiences that feel considered.</p><a class="card-link" href="/about">More about Abyss Hub →</a></div>
    <div class="feature-panel"><h3>How we approach our work</h3><div class="feature-row"><span class="feature-icon">01</span><div><strong>Purpose before complexity</strong><p>Start with the problem, then shape the right solution.</p></div></div><div class="feature-row"><span class="feature-icon">02</span><div><strong>Design with intention</strong><p>Build clear, coherent experiences across every touchpoint.</p></div></div><div class="feature-row"><span class="feature-icon">03</span><div><strong>Improve continuously</strong><p>Let each release create a stronger foundation for the next.</p></div></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Selected work</span><h2>Projects moving ideas forward.</h2><p>A selection of products and initiatives developed within the Abyss Hub ecosystem.</p></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card project-card"><div class="project-meta"><span class="card-kicker">Digital project</span><span class="status">Live</span></div><h3>Adiwarna</h3><p>A live digital project with its own dedicated online experience.</p><a class="card-link" href="/projects/adiwarna">Discover Adiwarna →</a></article>
      <article class="card project-card"><div class="project-meta"><span class="card-kicker">Digital currency</span><span class="status">In development</span></div><h3>VoidXpay (VPX)</h3><p>A digital currency and financial technology ecosystem in development.</p><a class="card-link" href="/projects/vpx">Explore the project →</a></article>
      <article class="card project-card"><div class="project-meta"><span class="card-kicker">Minecraft server</span><span class="status">Planning</span></div><h3>Abyss Minecraft Server</h3><p>A planned multiplayer Minecraft experience currently taking shape.</p><a class="card-link" href="/projects/minecraft-server">Explore the project →</a></article>
    </div><div style="margin-top:26px"><a class="button secondary" href="/projects">View all projects →</a></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container cta-band"><div><span class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</span><h2>Have something in mind?</h2><p>We welcome thoughtful enquiries, collaboration ideas, and opportunities to build something meaningful.</p></div><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact Abyss Hub ↗</a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>